description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch up to 4 Slashes forward, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> Stage 4 is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Drawn Stance]</color>;

While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Roaming Stance]</color> with available <color=#FFFFFF>[Gun Retraction]</color> counts, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Activates the corresponding <color=#FFFFFF>[Gun Retraction]</color> based on the current segment, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Gun Retraction]</color> has 3 segments in total, and each use advances the segment count;
Using Gun Retraction after a Basic Attack preserves the Basic Attack segment count;
DMG taken is reduced by 40% during this skill;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> to activate:
Condenses ice at the gun's tip to deliver a powerful counter against enemies ahead, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Triggering a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> and launching a Dodge Counter during a Basic Attack preserves the current Basic Attack chain;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Draw Stance</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launch a powerful Pierce against enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color>. Each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color> increases the DMG dealt by subsequent Retract Stance by 15%, stacking up to 2 times. <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color> are removed after the 3rd Retract Stance ends;
When this skill hits an elite or Boss-Rank enemy in Daze for the first time, the current <color=#FFFFFF>[Retract Stance]</color> stage is recorded and <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> is activated. This effect can trigger at most once per Daze;
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Aerial Gunstance]</color> duration does not decrease, and holding <IconMap:Icon_Normal> allows continuous use of Retract Stance from Stage 1 through Stage 3;
After activating the 3rd stage of <color=#FFFFFF>[Retract Stance]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> ends and the <color=#FFFFFF>[Retract Stance]</color> stage is restored;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Draw Stance]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Channels the power of extreme cold to unleash a devastating series of dashes forward, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Draw</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

